      <mxCell id="C15" value="9B make build-language-embeddings&#xa;入力：surface_manifest.tsv&#xa;処理：英日BERT、max_length=32、padding/truncation、attention mask mean pooling&#xa;出力：data/external/embeddings/language/&lt;en|ja&gt;/&lt;run&gt;/embeddings.npy + IDs + metadata" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="2345" width="330" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
